@local/token-breakdown-stats README · How it works：The `compact` / `detailed` preference is read from the same `ui-chat` config
scope the shipped pill uses; `compact` keeps the plain speed and cache-hit
readings without dialogs.

@local/token-breakdown-stats README · Install incident (2026-10-15)：Two smoke-test mocks reproduce both failure modes so a regression fails the
test instead of a boot: the context throws on undeclared service access, and
the slot service rejects a duplicate cell at the same priority.
